---
description: Enforce the repository's pinned agent-project-ops project-operations contract.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read root `AGENTS.md` and the pinned `.agent-project-ops/PRINCIPLES.md` before changing project state.

Do not treat chat, a local checkout, or a projection remote as a second source of truth. Topic branches push to `origin` only; unknown remotes fail closed; PR merge is not Phase PASS.

Before the first push in a fresh clone, verify `git config --get core.hooksPath` is `.githooks`; otherwise run `.agent-project-ops/scripts/install-hooks.sh`.
